// The rites of the temple of the Still Water: what Mereholt's priest does for whoever
// stands beside them and pays. A rite is a verb the priest offers, not a thing anyone
// carries, so it is never in `items.ron`; it is written in the same effect words, so a
// rite and the scroll or potion that does the same cannot drift apart.
//
// Every field:
//   verb:     the word the priest offers it by, one row a word, and never "trade", the
//             engine's own; `src/temple.rs` declares each as a verb and answers it
//   says:     what the offers screen lists it as, the whole row: the engine's own words
//             would be the verb and the priest's name, "name the priest", which is not what
//             the rite does
//   idle:     what the priest is said to do when the rite would do nothing for whoever took it
//             up, a wound to close, a lasting status, a worn thing held on or one not known
//             whole being what each word has to do: said after the priest's name and before
//             ", and gives back your 30 gold coins.", the price given back, since it was paid
//             before the rite was answered
//   price:    what taking it up costs, in gold coins, more than nought: refused to anyone
//             carrying less, and paid into the priest's purse before it lands. The same all
//             run, and never out of stock
//   effects:  [(kind:, chance:, args:)] what it lands on whoever took it up, as their own
//             use of it, the effect words of `items.ron`'s header: the engine's Mend(roll:),
//             Cleanse(status:) and Inflict(status:, turns:), and Undermere's own, those that
//             land on the user: RemoveCurse, everything worn free to come off; Strengthen(by:);
//             Life(by:); Whole, health made whole; CureLasting, every status that lasts until
//             cured cured, but what a worn thing holds; NameWorn, everything worn known, its
//             kind and its level, and so its curse. A word that reads where a use was aimed
//             or the thing it was read on, Enchant, Identify, Blink and the rest, has nothing
//             to land on here and does nothing
[
    (verb: "mend", says: "mend your wounds", idle: "finds nothing to mend", price: 30, effects: [(kind: "Whole"), (kind: "CureLasting")]),
    (verb: "unbind", says: "unbind what you wear", idle: "finds nothing bound on you", price: 60, effects: [(kind: "RemoveCurse")]),
    (verb: "name", says: "name what you wear", idle: "has nothing to tell you of what you wear", price: 60, effects: [(kind: "NameWorn")]),
]
